# ACL do Mosquitto do dev single (auditoria run-4, onda 2). Um bloco por usuário; nada fora daqui é permitido.
# Contrato: packages/contracts/mqtt.md. Os tópicos $aws/... são escritos por extenso (curinga no início não casa com $).

# API (LocalMqttTransport + shadow local + estações): o shadow do servidor publica delta/accepted/documents/get.
user api
topic readwrite motos/#
topic readwrite estacoes/#
topic readwrite $aws/things/#
topic read $aws/events/#

# Ponte GT06 (services/traccar-bridge): só o lado do aparelho. Nunca escreve delta/desired nem comandos.
user traccar-bridge
topic write motos/+/telemetria
topic write motos/+/eventos
topic read motos/+/comandos
topic write $aws/things/+/shadow/update
topic write $aws/things/+/shadow/get
topic read $aws/things/+/shadow/update/delta
topic read $aws/things/+/shadow/get/accepted
topic write $aws/events/presence/+/+

# Simulador de rastreadores (services/iot-sim): o mesmo lado do aparelho.
user iot-sim
topic write motos/+/telemetria
topic write motos/+/eventos
topic read motos/+/comandos
topic write $aws/things/+/shadow/update
topic write $aws/things/+/shadow/get
topic read $aws/things/+/shadow/update/delta
topic read $aws/things/+/shadow/get/accepted
topic write $aws/events/presence/+/+

# Observador do e2e do GT06 (gt06.sh e2e, mosquitto_sub dentro do container): só leitura; senha aleatória do start.sh.
user observador
topic read motos/#
topic read $aws/things/#
